%% alt: The flow where Spring creates implementations at app startup, stores them as Beans in the container, and injects the type the constructor requires when creating a Controller
flowchart TD
  A["App starts"] --> B["Create implementations one by one<br/>GradeServiceImpl · LoginService"]
  B --> C["Store in container<br/>These objects are Beans"]
  C --> D["Time to create GradeController"]
  D --> E["Constructor requires GradeService type"]
  E --> F["Pull GradeServiceImpl from the box and inject it"]
